###
# 中文：这个文件不保存真实密码或 JWT 密钥。只在本地临时替换下面两个占位符，
# 运行后不要把真实值提交到 Git。
# English: This file contains no real password or JWT signing secret. Replace the two
# placeholders locally only, then do not commit real values to Git.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = change-me-before-running
@password = change-me-before-running

### Login: expected HTTP 200 and code OK.
# IDEA HTTP Client stores the response token only in its local client session.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Trace-Id: af-manual-login-001

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("agentflowAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### Current user with no token: expected HTTP 401 and AUTH_UNAUTHENTICATED.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
X-Trace-Id: af-manual-me-no-token-001

### Current user with the token saved by the Login request: expected HTTP 200 and code OK.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{agentflowAccessToken}}
X-Trace-Id: af-manual-me-with-token-001

### Current user with an invalid token: expected HTTP 401 and AUTH_TOKEN_INVALID.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-token
X-Trace-Id: af-manual-me-invalid-token-001
